// THE srv2 DEPLOYMENT'S ENTRY. Same selection-by-entry-function shape the rest of this family
// follows, so which instance a process serves is fixed by its launch argument for the process's
// whole life rather than re-derived per request from an ambient fact.
fn roadmap_serve_handle_srv2_deploy(
